        "book": "The Book of Helaman",
        "chapter": 1,
        "verse": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "But behold, Paanchi, and that part of the people that were desirous that he should be their governor, was exceedingly wroth; therefore, he was about to flatter away those people to rise up in rebellion against their brethren.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 152,
            "end": 159,
            "text": "Mosiah 27:8; Alma 50:35; Hel. 2:5; Ether 8:2."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 7,
        "crossReferences": [
