        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "The Book of Helaman 1:7",
        "book": "The Book of Helaman",
        "chapter": 1,
        "verse": 7
      },
      {
        "text": "And it came to pass as he was about to do this, behold, he was taken, and was tried according to the voice of the people, and condemned unto death; for he had raised up in rebellion and sought to destroy the liberty of the people.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 101,
            "end": 106,
            "text": "Alma 1:14 (10–15)."
          },
          {
            "start": 208,
            "end": 215,
            "text": "TG Liberty."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 8,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "TG Liberty.",
