        "book": "The Book of Helaman",
        "chapter": 1,
        "verse": 15
      },
      {
        "text": "Therefore, the king of the Lamanites, whose name was Tubaloth, who was the son of Ammoron, supposing that Coriantumr, being a mighty man, could stand against the Nephites, with his strength and also with his great wisdom, insomuch that by sending him forth he should gain power over the Nephites—",
        "footNotes": [
