      {
        "text": "Therefore he did stir them up to anger, and he did gather together his armies, and he did appoint Coriantumr to be their leader, and did cause that they should march down to the land of Zarahemla to battle against the Nephites.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 17,
            "end": 21,
            "text": "Alma 35:10; 47:1."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 17,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "Alma 35:10; 47:1.",
            "prettyString": "Alma 35:10; 47:1",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "scripture",
                "book": "alma",
                "chapters": [
                  {
                    "start": 35,
                    "end": 35,
