        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "The Book of Helaman 1:22",
        "book": "The Book of Helaman",
        "chapter": 1,
        "verse": 22
      },
      {
        "text": "And now he did not tarry in the land of Zarahemla, but he did march forth with a large army, even towards the city of Bountiful; for it was his determination to go forth and cut his way through with the sword, that he might obtain the north parts of the land.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 118,
            "end": 127,
            "text": "Alma 22:29."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 23,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "Alma 22:29.",
            "prettyString": "Alma 22:29",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "scripture",
                "book": "alma",
                "chapters": [
                  {
                    "start": 22,
                    "end": 22,
                    "verses": [
                      {
                        "start": 29,
                        "end": 29
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "The Book of Helaman 1:23",
        "book": "The Book of Helaman",
        "chapter": 1,
        "verse": 23
      },
      {
        "text": "And, supposing that their greatest strength was in the center of the land, therefore he did march forth, giving them no time to assemble themselves together save it were in small bodies; and in this manner they did fall upon them and cut them down to the earth.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 24,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "The Book of Helaman 1:24",
        "book": "The Book of Helaman",
        "chapter": 1,
        "verse": 24
      },
      {
        "text": "But behold, this march of Coriantumr through the center of the land gave Moronihah great advantage over them, notwithstanding the greatness of the number of the Nephites who were slain.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 25,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "The Book of Helaman 1:25",
        "book": "The Book of Helaman",
        "chapter": 1,
        "verse": 25
      },
      {
